    {
      "id": "polar-bear",
      "title": {
        "en": "My Beloved Polar Bear",
        "zh": "我心爱的北极熊"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "en": "A mobile game prototype for climate action",
        "zh": "鼓励气候行动的手机游戏原型"
      },
      "date_range": {
        "start": "2024-01",
        "end": "2024-03",
        "label": {
          "en": "January–March 2024",
          "zh": "2024 年 1–3 月"
        }
      },
      "role": {
        "en": "Prototype and interface development lead",
        "zh": "原型与界面开发负责人"
      },
      "collaborators": [
        "Abdullah Alghazouli",
        "Isidora Pardo-Devillaine",
        "Harris Dalal",
        "Quynh-My Pham-Nguyen",
        "Bianca Gao",
        "Dannon Sanders",
        "Irene Liao"
      ],
      "overview": {
        "en": "Care for a virtual polar bear by completing small climate-friendly actions in daily life. Our Tamagotchi-inspired prototype turns those actions into coins for food and clothing, giving players a companion to return to.",
        "zh": "通过日常的小小环保行动，照顾一只虚拟北极熊。这款受到 Tamagotchi 启发的原型，把行动转换成购买食物和服装的金币，让玩家有一个想要回来探望的伙伴。"
      },
      "links": [],
      "sections": [
        {
          "id": "why-a-digital-pet",
          "title": {
            "en": "Why a digital pet?",
            "zh": "为什么是一只电子宠物？"
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "en": "Our survey reached more than 100 people, primarily Gen Z students. Many already took small climate-friendly actions but wanted encouragement to keep going; educational games often felt unappealing. We considered racing, a recycling RPG, and a digital pet. The pet offered a clear connection between everyday action and care, within a scope our team could prototype.",
              "zh": "我们的问卷收集了 100 多人的反馈，主要是 Z 世代学生。许多人已经在做小规模环保行动，却需要持续行动的动力，也觉得教育游戏缺乏吸引力。团队比较了赛车、回收主题 RPG 和电子宠物三个方向。宠物把日常行动与照料直接联系起来，也适合团队当时能够完成的原型规模。"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "assets/portfolio/page-08-image-02.png",
              "width": 1437,
              "height": 704,
              "caption": {
                "en": "Large-scale and small-scale climate action survey results",
                "zh": "大规模与小规模气候行动的调查结果"
              },
              "small": false
            }
          ],
          "layout": "paired"
        },
        {
          "id": "testing-two-ways-through",
          "title": {
            "en": "Testing two ways through",
            "zh": "比较两种操作方式"
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "en": "In Figma, we tested two versions of customization, task progress, and task history. I designed Flow B. We recorded completion times, self-ratings, and comments during task-based sessions. The feedback favored B as the more intuitive option, helping us choose which flow to develop further.",
              "zh": "我们在 Figma 中为装扮、任务进度与任务历史设计了两种流程，我负责 Flow B。任务测试记录了完成时间、自评和参与者的意见，反馈更倾向于 B 版，也帮助我们确定了下一步继续完善的方向。"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "assets/portfolio/page-09-image-01.png",
              "width": 1197,
              "height": 422,
              "caption": {
                "en": "Task browsing low-fidelity wireframes",
                "zh": "任务浏览的低保真线框图"
              },
              "small": false
            },
            {
              "src": "assets/portfolio/page-09-image-02.png",
              "width": 952,
              "height": 659,
              "caption": {
                "en": "Task history and calendar low-fidelity wireframes",
                "zh": "任务历史与日历的低保真线框图"
              },
              "small": false
            }
          ],
          "layout": "wide",
          "gallery_layout": "pair"
        },
        {
          "id": "bringing-care-into-the-interface",
          "title": {
            "en": "Bringing care into the interface",
            "zh": "把照料放进界面"
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "en": "The resulting home screen brings tasks, progress, and streaks together. I designed the feeding and customization systems, including the inventory, icons, items, and tasks. A food shop, friends page, and profile extend the same daily loop: choose an action, earn coins, and spend time with the bear.",
              "zh": "迭代后的主界面把任务、进度和连续完成记录放在一起。我设计了喂养与装扮系统，包括物品栏、图标、道具和任务。食物商店、好友页和个人资料，围绕同一个日常循环展开：选择行动、获得金币，再回来陪伴北极熊。"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "assets/portfolio/page-10-image-01.png",
              "width": 234,
